/PROGRAM UTIL2.SB
/----------------
/
/
/
/
/UTIL2.SB  - A MODIFIED UTILTY.SB FOR THE PS/8 FORTRAN LIBRARY
/-------------------------------------------------------------
/
/
/
/
/	PETER LEMKIN
/	NATIONAL INSTITUTES OF  HEALTH
/	BETHESDA, MD 20014
/
/
